The compile straight from CIR, at -O0 and -O1, replaced Coil's port of TPDE
(coil-tpde, https://github.com/jimmyhmiller/coil-tpde), which set the bar it
had to meet. CIR itself, and the object assembler the backend writes into,
come from there: see native/NOTICE.

